th records platform that is aiming to reduce the 100+ plus steps it takes optometrists to document an eye exam. Co-Founder and CTO Allan Wang is front and center of it all. The platform helps engineers find great jobs by assessing their abilities, not by relying on \u201cI had to send 2000 messages to hire two developers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/0586d7d132af945664818ceb5071afd3","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-11-01T16:20:45.627Z"},{"id":"wE3TN83X3","title":"Yoop automatically recruits qualified engineers with Triplebyte Magnet","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/yoop-automatically-recruits-qualified-engineers-with-triplebyte-magnet","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/yoop-automatically-recruits-qualified-engineers-with-triplebyte-magnet-we3tn83x3","summary":"Yoop eSpaces created a high-quality production at a fraction of the cost of traditional events or tours. The company exploded onto the scene during the height of the COVID-19 pandemic. Venkat Ganesan is the Chief Technology Officer of Yoop, a virtual events platform that creates spaces to allow musicians and performers to connect in a new and more intimate way.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/10b9efaa3d7ecd9fcc923a7e0875d861","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-10-18T15:12:01.510Z"},{"id":"KJ6nPJcYu","title":"Arcules saves time identifying qualified engineers with Triplebyte Screen","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/arcules-saves-time-identifying-qualified-engineers-with-triplebyte-screen","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/arcules-saves-time-identifying-qualified-engineers-with-triplebyte-screen-kj6npjcyu","summary":"Arcules uses Triplebyte Screen to find and hire the right engineers for their team. The company has almost 50% increase in applicants to the company over the last quarter. Arcules is a cloud-based surveillance, access control, and video analytics company that uses heat map analytics and people counters to help optimize space usage in patient waiting rooms.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/43f12805978c9ce203769a031e21b9df","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-29T23:47:56.925Z"},{"id":"5C3f_hjhn","title":"Using Triplebyte Magnet to hire 19 contract engineers in just 6 weeks","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/using-triplebyte-magnet-to-hire-19-contract-engineers-in-6-weeks","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/using-triplebyte-magnet-to-hire-19-contract-engineers-in-just-6-weeks-5c3f-hjhn","summary":"Triplebyte Screen is the industry-leading technical assessment tool for vetting engineering skills. Using Triplebyte Magnet to hire 19 contract engineers in just 6 weeks - 4x higher interview pass rate. The efficiency gains with Magnet have allowed Matt McCarley to make an average of three hires per week, which is 5x the previous rate.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/766ef4d3c55d8304630cc99277612465","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-23T19:53:32.211Z"},{"id":"0hQmnzEHW","title":"Discovering star-power: how BakerHughes uncovered their next rising star engineers","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/discovering-star-power-how-bakerhughes-uncovered-their-next-rising-star-engineers","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/discovering-star-power-how-bakerhughes-uncovered-their-next-rising-star-engineers-0hqmnzehw","summary":"BakerHughes uncovered their next rising star engineers. Hiring top engineer talent out of college and/or university is expensive, competitive, and a major drain of resources. Hiring managers face the next battle, and how are they certain they\u2019re not missing out on rockstar engineers due to volume limitation, resume-flipping fatigue, and outdated processes?","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/fb4a85705276fe33dc53dd169f0db0b0","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-22T20:38:51.686Z"},{"id":"QGI0Y4uuO","title":"New: Blockchain and Solidity Quizzes from Triplebyte Screen","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/new-blockchain-and-solidity-quizzes-from-triplebyte-screen","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/new-blockchain-and-solidity-quizzes-from-triplebyte-screen-qgi0y4uuo","summary":"2021 saw a 395% surge in web3 job postings, according to a study conducted by LinkedIn and published earlier this year. Triplebyte Screen\u2019s new Blockchain Architecture Quiz identifies and evaluates a candidate's understanding of blockchain architecture, design, development, and implementation of a decentralized computer as it is updated and validated by countless ecosystem participants.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/33ab6303e682430d825bde14ae89b973","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-20T20:02:33.358Z"},{"id":"9UXIj3_mh","title":"Introducing Magnet: a smarter way to hire engineers","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/introducting-magnet","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/introducing-magnet-a-smarter-way-to-hire-engineers-9uxij3-mh","summary":"Magnet - to steal the title of a famous Python book - automates the boring stuff. It takes those hundreds of applications and hundreds of messages and brings both down to the single digits. It doesn't tell companies who to hire (and it doesn't try to) but it does remove the game of mass messaging from both sides. This stops \u201cdead\u201d campaigns (e.g.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b7353b51804c6a0172e2e455f45f4e16","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-20T19:57:24.149Z"},{"id":"ppdhX2d1l","title":"Hiring the best technical talent in a fraction of the time \u23f1\ufe0f","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/hiring-the-best-technical-talent-in-a-fraction-of-the-time","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/hiring-the-best-technical-talent-in-a-fraction-of-the-time--ppdhx2d1l","summary":"Triplebyte has released a new feature called Magnet, which essentially automates top-of-funnel sourcing, outreach, and qualification efforts. Magnet removes the need to manually search, scroll through profiles, scan resumes, and send cold outreach messages.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a2654c52b0d1ab9bb809b4db67c435be","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-09-19T21:13:53.894Z"},{"id":"IwUjwVXu2","title":"How to get engineers to respond to you","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/how-to-get-engineers-to-respond-to-you","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-get-engineers-to-respond-to-you-iwujwvxu2","summary":"Talented engineers take Triplebyte Screen assessments to validate their skills and often skip the tech screen for many roles on our platform. To stand out to top talent, your outreach must cut through the noise and get to the point\u2013quickly.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/64ba25bb25dd5476c444e6b31c0b0a92","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-04T20:09:25.605Z"},{"id":"wjFZxa0NU","title":"How we wring every last bit of data out of a short quiz","url":"https://compiler.triplebyte.com/blog/screening-psychometrics-engineering-quizzes","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-we-wring-every-last-bit-of-data-out-of-a-short-quiz-wjfzxa0nu","summary":"Triplebyte uses multicategorical Item Response Theory (IRT) to score questions. In IRT models, responses are categorized as correct or incorrect, and we model the probability of getting a correct response as a function of underlying skill. The additional categories add granularity to our scoring scale, which translates to more precision in our score estimates.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/1